<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>主页</title><description>你好，我是 James</description><link>https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/</link><item><title>Career Coach 复盘：当方法论掉进真实场景</title><link>https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/projects/project-4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/projects/project-4/</guid><description>把方法论真正跑进求职场景之后，工作台与抽屉、状态卡和内外文本边界，哪些做法站得住、哪些会在真实使用里失效。</description><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>QuickNotes</title><link>https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/projects/project-5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/projects/project-5/</guid><description>一次用 Agentic Coding 推进的轻量笔记产品原型，探索 Agent 如何参与从想法到可用界面的快速迭代。</description><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>README：Career Coach</title><link>https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/projects/project-3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/projects/project-3/</guid><description>围绕数周至数月的求职准备，用本地 Markdown 与 coding agent 搭建状态看板、上下文路由和目标校准，让 Agent 能稳定接续长期任务。</description><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>当 Agent 成为标配，产品真正争什么</title><link>https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/blog/12-%E5%BD%93-agent-%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E6%A0%87%E9%85%8D%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E4%BA%89%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/blog/12-%E5%BD%93-agent-%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E6%A0%87%E9%85%8D%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E4%BA%89%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88/</guid><description>当模型、RAG 和工具调用逐一成为标配，产品还能靠什么建立长期价值？我从可信供给、任务现场和执行反馈三个层面，重新理解 Agent 竞争的实质。</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>如果 Codex 要走出代码项目</title><link>https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/blog/09-%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C-codex/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/blog/09-%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C-codex/</guid><description>Coding agent 要走出代码项目，先得承认：任务往往从材料里长出来，而不是从输入框里长出来。围绕想法孵化、意图表达和任务主线，谈 Codex 还缺的三层产品结构。</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>产品分析：OpenClaw &amp; WorkBuddy</title><link>https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/blog/11-workbuddyopenclaw/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/blog/11-workbuddyopenclaw/</guid><description>以 WorkBuddy 和 OpenClaw 为样本，分析执行型 Agent 能否从「能动手」走到「可被委托」。重点不在 demo 炫技，而在预览确认、失败接管、任务历史和工作流写回。</description><pubDate>Tue, 30 Dec 2025 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Agent 产品机会与护城河</title><link>https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/blog/10-agent-%E6%9C%BA%E4%BC%9A%E6%8A%A4%E5%9F%8E%E6%B2%B3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/blog/10-agent-%E6%9C%BA%E4%BC%9A%E6%8A%A4%E5%9F%8E%E6%B2%B3/</guid><description>一把判断 Agent 方向值不值得做的四问框架：任务是否重要、Agent 是否有增量、公司是否有优势、做成后是否守得住。附 Career Coach、WorkBuddy、ima 等方向的快速套用示例。</description><pubDate>Tue, 30 Dec 2025 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Agent 的下一步：从回答问题，到让事情顺理成章地发生</title><link>https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/blog/13-agent-%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%E4%BB%8E%E5%9B%9E%E7%AD%94%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E5%88%B0%E8%AE%A9%E4%BA%8B%E6%83%85%E9%A1%BA%E7%90%86%E6%88%90%E7%AB%A0%E5%9C%B0%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://astro-nano-demo.vercel.app/blog/13-agent-%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%E4%BB%8E%E5%9B%9E%E7%AD%94%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E5%88%B0%E8%AE%A9%E4%BA%8B%E6%83%85%E9%A1%BA%E7%90%86%E6%88%90%E7%AB%A0%E5%9C%B0%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F/</guid><description>好 Agent 也许像管家：不替你做决定，却在合适的时刻把该看的东西摆到面前。从聚会、开会到点外卖，三个场景看 Agent 如何从「给答案」走向「让下一步变轻」。</description><pubDate>Tue, 30 Dec 2025 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>